386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 296 0 R
/E (Every great brand has a story. Estuscia was not created in a boardroom it was born from one of the most difficult moments of my life.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
387 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 296 0 R
/T (From a Personal Loss to a Purpose-Driven Vision)
/E (From a Personal Loss to a Purpose-Driven Vision)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
388 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 296 0 R
/E (I was preparing to move to Estonia on a work visa. After months of planning and saving, my visa process was almost complete. Just before that dream became reality, I became the victim of a financial scam. The money I had worked so hard to save was stolen, and with it came uncertainty, disappointment, and countless unanswered questions about my future.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
389 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 296 0 R
/E (As I struggled to recover, I discovered that I was not alone. My family, friends, and many people from my hometown had also experienced financial scams. Some had lost their life savings, while others faced severe emotional distress because of the financial burden. Seeing how deeply these scams affected ordinary people changed the way I looked at the financial world.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
390 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 296 0 R
/E (For nearly two months, I stayed isolated, reflecting on what had happened. During that time, I made a decision that would shape the future of my life. Instead of allowing that experience to define me, I chose to build something that could help prevent others from going through the same pain.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
391 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 296 0 R
/E (That decision became the foundation of a larger vision:)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
